# Example Mosquitto ACL for the T28 Victron overlay. No live passwords.
# Split users: receivers must not be able to overwrite the Instant Readout key list.
#
# Create users with mosquitto_passwd. Do not commit the password file.

# Hub user on demo-hub: source of truth for devices + IR keys.
user t28-config
topic write demo/power/config/#
topic read demo/power/#

# Receiver user on each Pi: consume fleet config, publish last-heard.
# Intentionally no write to demo/power/config/#.
user t28-publish
topic read demo/power/config/#
topic write demo/power/heard/#
